---
layout: layout.njk
title: Health Education
description: Patient and community health education materials.
category: Health Education
---

<div class="category-header">
    <div class="cat-icon">💊</div>
    <h1>Health Education</h1>
    <p class="cat-desc">Ready-made health education materials and patient teaching plans on disease prevention, lifestyle modification, maternal and child health, and community wellness. Designed for ANM, GNM, and BSc Nursing practical files.</p>
</div>

<div class="post-list">
{% for post in collections.healthEducation reversed %}
    <div class="post-card">
        <div class="post-info">
            <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
            <p class="post-meta">{{ post.date | date: "%B %d, %Y" }} | {{ post.data.focus }}</p>
        </div>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="btn">View Material</a>
    </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>
